flowchart TD
    Start([Survey of 12 papers]) --> CompareMatrix[Comparison Matrix<br/>12 rows x 11 columns]
    CompareMatrix --> Patterns{Column-wide<br/>patterns?}
    Patterns -->|yes| GapScan[Dimension scan<br/>7 gap-type classes]
    Patterns -->|no| EndSurvey[No gaps to report]

    GapScan --> TypeClass{Gap<br/>type?}
    TypeClass --> M[Method gap<br/>G4: engineering vs training]
    TypeClass --> D[Data gap<br/>e.g. multi-modal long memory]
    TypeClass --> P[Population gap<br/>G2: multi-user memory]
    TypeClass --> S[Setting-transfer gap<br/>e.g. cross-domain transfer]
    TypeClass --> T[Theory gap<br/>G3: stability-plasticity<br/>G7: soft attention budget]
    TypeClass --> E[Evaluation gap<br/>G1: compute cost<br/>G5: schema quality]
    TypeClass --> N[Negative-result gap<br/>G6: reflection on strong bases]

    M --> Feas[Feasibility<br/>4-axis verdict]
    D --> Feas
    P --> Feas
    S --> Feas
    T --> Feas
    E --> Feas
    N --> Feas

    Feas -->|doable| Doable[Single-paper<br/>opportunities<br/>G1, G3, G4, G5, G6]
    Feas -->|cautious| Cautious[Longer-horizon<br/>G2, G7, multi-modal]
    Feas -->|not advised| Drop[Drop with reason]

    Doable --> Output[Section VII:<br/>7 research gaps in survey]
    Cautious --> Output
    Drop --> Output

    Output --> Survey[Survey paper:<br/>taxonomy + design map<br/>+ evaluation audit + gap list]
